{"seq":2,"slug":"keeping-tooling-healthy","title":"保持工具链健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance/keeping-tooling-healthy","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"保持工具链健康\">保持工具链健康</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>工具链是 agent 赖以工作的物理环境：包管理器、构建器、测试器、linter、git 钩子、CI。它几乎不会一夜报废，只会缓慢腐烂——构建每月慢几秒，依赖落后上游一个小版本，配置里多一条没人敢删的 workaround。腐烂最危险之处在于无感：每一周看起来都「还能用」，直到某天迭代速度掉到不可接受，而那时的修复成本已是早期介入的许多倍。本文讲清四个腐烂维度与它们的可测量信号，解释为什么腐烂会自我加速，最后给出一套可持续的最小维护循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>腐烂是无感的慢性过程。</strong> 工具链几乎不会一夜报废，只会每周「还能用」地缓慢变差，直到某天迭代速度掉到不可接受。</li>\n<li><strong>四个维度各有可测量信号。</strong> 构建变慢、依赖过期、工具老旧、配置怪味——信号必须可度量（如「冷构建 P50 从 40 秒涨到 90 秒」），「感觉变慢了」不算信号。</li>\n<li><strong>欠账会复利。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_t = D_0(1+r)^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0436em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，指数增长来自升级成本的超线性、知识流失与注意力挤压三个正反馈，所以越晚维护越贵。</li>\n<li><strong>对策是小步循环而非大扫除。</strong> 固定预算的测量→排期→小步升级→清理→验证循环，配合缓存与提交门禁让改善留存。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"四个维度与可测量的信号\">四个维度与可测量的信号</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>可执行的对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构建变慢</td>\n<td>冷构建时长逐月上升，热更新超过秒级</td>\n<td>构建缓存、增量编译、更换更快的打包器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖过期</td>\n<td>漏洞告警累积，落后上游一至多个大版本</td>\n<td>自动化更新工具定期开 PR，小步合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具老旧</td>\n<td>新特性用不上，迁移欠账越滚越大</td>\n<td>大版本跟随计划：评估收益后择机切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置怪味</td>\n<td>注释掉的开关、无人能解释的 flag</td>\n<td>清理无效项，并把「为什么这么配」写进注释</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>信号必须可测量才有意义。「感觉变慢了」不是信号，「冷构建 P50 从 40 秒涨到 90 秒」才是。度量本身也要低成本可得：CI 日志里输出构建与测试时长、定期跑一次依赖过期报告（如 <code>npm outdated</code>）、把漏洞告警数记进看板——有了连续数字，趋势与回归才谈得上。CI 还给「慢」贴了直接的价签：GitHub Actions 按 runner 分钟计费，Windows 分钟单价 $0.010 起，而 macOS runner 的单价高于 Linux（<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/billing/concepts/product-billing/github-actions\">官方计费文档</a>）——构建每慢一分钟，都是全团队每次提交重复支付的现金成本。</p>\n<p>构建侧最大的杠杆是缓存命中。设冷构建耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、缓存命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，则平均单次构建时间近似</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\approx (1-h)\\,T_{cold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加速比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tfrac{1}{1-h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>：命中率 90% 就是十倍量级的差距。Docker 的 cache mount 机制正是为此设计——把包管理器的下载目录挂载为持久缓存，跨构建复用（<a href=\"https://docs.docker.com/build/cache/optimize/\">Docker 构建缓存文档</a>）。层缓存的<strong>次序</strong>同样是命中率的一部分：把不常变动的依赖清单文件先复制并安装、业务源码后放，改代码时依赖层才能继续命中；顺序颠倒的 Dockerfile 会把每次改动都放大成全量重装。反过来说，让缓存频繁失效是比「机器不够快」更常见的慢因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么腐烂会复利\">为什么腐烂会复利</h2><p>把欠账记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、月度恶化率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个月后欠账为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_t = D_0(1+r)^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0936em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>指数增长来自三个正反馈。第一，升级成本超线性：一次跨越多个大版本的升级要同时消化所有累积的不兼容变更，而对 npm 升级中「破坏性变更」的研究表明，理解和应对这些变更本身就是显著的工作量来源（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.14431\">arXiv:2408.14431</a>）——拖得越久，一次要消化的就越多。第二，知识流失：没人敢动那团配置，是因为唯一记得理由的人已经离开；越没人动，解释就越稀缺。第三，注意力挤压：烂环境逼着人把时间花在与工具搏斗上，维护反而更排不上期。「先赶功能，回头再修」的反模式之所以致命，就是因为它在调大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最小维护循环\">最小维护循环</h2><p>对抗复利的方式不是一次大扫除，而是固定预算的小步循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    M[&quot;测量: 时长与告警&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;排期: 固定预算&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; U[&quot;小步升级: 工具开 PR&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; C[&quot;清理: 死依赖死配置&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; V[&quot;验证: 提交门禁拦截回退&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; M\">flowchart LR\n    M[\"测量: 时长与告警\"] --&gt; P[\"排期: 固定预算\"]\n    P --&gt; U[\"小步升级: 工具开 PR\"]\n    U --&gt; C[\"清理: 死依赖死配置\"]\n    C --&gt; V[\"验证: 提交门禁拦截回退\"]\n    V --&gt; M</pre><p>循环里的「升级」在节奏上也有讲究：每周小批合并的自动 PR 通常优于季度集中升级。前者每次 diff 小、出问题容易定位回滚，破坏性变更在上游发布后一两周内就会暴露；后者把风险攒成一次大爆炸式迁移，而自动化更新工具普遍支持按分组、稳定性策略自动合并非破坏性升级，人工注意力只留给主版本跳跃。</p>\n<p>「升级」在 2025–2026 有几个值得评估的真实案例：Vite 8 已将 Rust 编写的 Rolldown 作为统一打包器内置发布（<a href=\"https://vite.dev/blog/announcing-vite8\">官方公告</a>）；Biome 2.0 提供不依赖 TypeScript 编译器的类型感知 lint 规则与多文件分析，可作为合并 ESLint 与 Prettier 职责的单工具候选（<a href=\"https://biomejs.dev/blog/biome-v2/\">发布公告</a>）。语言生态同理：Python 侧 uv 定位为 pip 与 pip-tools 的 drop-in 替代，并直接管理 Python 版本（<a href=\"https://astral.sh/blog/uv\">Astral 公告</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.astral.sh/uv/concepts/python-versions/\">版本管理文档</a>）；mise 则用单一 CLI 统一管理多语言的工具版本、环境变量与任务（<a href=\"https://mise.jdx.dev/\">mise 文档</a>）；git 钩子层 lefthook 以并行执行钩子任务见长（<a href=\"https://lefthook.dev/\">lefthook 文档</a>）。权衡在于：换工具是一次性迁移成本换长期速度，判断标准应是当前痛点是否真的被新工具解决，而非「新就一定好」。四个维度还会互相放大——旧打包器拖慢构建，过期依赖迫使升级，升级又撞上老旧工具的兼容墙；腐烂很少单独发生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本仓库的自检实例\">本仓库的自检实例</h2><p>这套循环在本仓库有具体落点。<code>lefthook.yml</code> 的 pre-commit 钩子以 <code>parallel: true</code> 同时跑五类检查——Biome 检查 web 代码、Prettier 格式化 markdown、内容 CLI 校验 <code>hubs/**/*.md</code>、TypeScript 全量类型检查、i18n 硬编码扫描——任何一类回归都在提交瞬间被拦下，而不是等 CI 或线上发现。质量门与开发命令收敛到 <code>make help</code> 一张命令面，<code>make check</code> 一键跑 lint 加 typecheck 加 test。健康的标准因此很具体：有度量入口（时长、告警数）、有小步修复通道（自动化 PR 与定期清理）、有防回退的门禁（提交时校验）——三者齐备，腐烂才会在早期被看见、被便宜地处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>工具链腐烂是带复利的慢性过程：四个维度各有可测量信号，CI 计费让「慢」有了现金价签。对策不是大扫除而是固定预算的小步循环，配合缓存与门禁让改善留存。早维护便宜，晚维护付的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1+r)^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0436em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"dependency-management\">依赖管理</a>——「依赖过期」维度的深入治理与加依赖的规矩。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../fast-feedback-from-the-toolchain/fast-builds-and-dev-loop\">快速构建与开发循环</a>——「构建变慢」维度的对策库。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保持工具链健康","id":"保持工具链健康"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四个维度与可测量的信号","id":"四个维度与可测量的信号"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么腐烂会复利","id":"为什么腐烂会复利"},{"level":2,"text":"最小维护循环","id":"最小维护循环"},{"level":2,"text":"本仓库的自检实例","id":"本仓库的自检实例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance/dependency-management"},"next":{"title":"把工具链写进上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance/documenting-the-toolchain"}}